  "news": "Lead with the event, then source, then reaction. Short, active, past-tense sentences, named officials with function and κ./κα on second reference, exact times and numbers, attribution by δήλωσε or ανέφερε. No colour adjectives, no closing moral; end on what happens next or a date.",
